cards:[['Who described India as "quasi-federal"?','**K.C. Wheare**'],['Who coined "co-operative federalism" for India?','**Granville Austin**'],['Which case held federalism a basic feature?','**S.R. Bommai (1994)**'],['Is representation of States in RS equal?','**No**, based on population'],['Is India a coming-together or holding-together federation?','**Holding-together**'],['Which case held GST Council recommendations not binding?','**Mohit Minerals (2022)**']],
